# Third-party components

This repository contains original scripts, configuration and documentation
(licensed MIT, see `LICENSE`) and build instructions for an image that
redistributes the following open-source components:

| Component | Version | License | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| OpenWrt | 24.10.8 | GPL-2.0 | https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/tree/v24.10.8 |
| Linux kernel | 6.6.144 | GPL-2.0 | https://www.kernel.org/ |
| MPD | 0.23.15 | GPL-2.0-or-later | https://www.musicpd.org/ |
| myMPD | 26.1.1 | GPL-3.0-or-later | https://github.com/jcorporation/myMPD |
| upmpdcli | 1.8.11 | GPL-3.0-or-later | https://www.lesbonscomptes.com/upmpdcli/ |
| LuCI | 24.10 | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/openwrt/luci |
| libmpdclient | 2.22 | BSD-3-Clause | https://www.musicpd.org/libs/libmpdclient/ |

## Modifications

- myMPD: `-Werror` removed from `CMakeLists.txt`
  (`patches/mympd-26.1.1-remove-werror.patch`).
- MPD: built with `-Ddsd=true` (no source changes).
- Binaries are stripped and rebuilt with path mapping; see `build.sh`.

## Source availability

Corresponding source is available from the upstream URLs above, plus the
patches and build scripts in this repository (`patches/`, `build/`,
`docs/BUILD.md`, `build.sh`). The image is an aggregate of these components;
the MIT licence applies only to the original material in this repository.
